--==========================================================================================
-- QUBESFOLDER(c) DEMO MODEL
--==========================================================================================

-- CUBE: A set of MEASURES qualified by DIMENSIONS
-- DIMENSION: An analytical axis for qualifying CUBE data
-- HIERARCHY: A roll-up tree of DIMENSIONS elements
-- MEASURE: A numerical attribute of CUBE data, aggregated across DIMENSIONS via HIERARCHY
-- Area defines a CUBE's subset by DIMENSIONS ranges
--
-- SYNTAX
-- A command An object A name
-- New line as a separator of elements
-- Semicolon as an end of a command ';'
-- Double minus is a line comment '--'
-- Single or double quotes for strings

--==========================================================================================

